OL,3,GNEWSAMum hopes Strep B vaccine trial
OL,4,Acan save babies across the world
OL,5,
OL,6,FFive years ago, first-time mum Menna
OL,7,FHulme had to be given antibiotics
OL,8,Fintravenously during labour to make
OL,9,Fsure she and her baby were safe.
OL,11,FShe was found to have Group B
OL,12,FStreptococcus (GBS) in her pregnancy,
OL,13,Fan infection that affects one in 1,750
OL,14,Fbabies in the UK and kills one a week.
OL,16,FWhile expecting her third child, Hulme
OL,17,Fbecame the first woman in Europe to
OL,18,Fsign up to a vaccine trial, run by Prof
OL,19,FWill Parry-Smith from Keele University,
OL,20,Fin an attempt to mitigate the effects
OL,21,Fof GBS.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,358,350,200,160,0,100
