OL,3,GNEWSAMum hopes Strep B vaccine trial
OL,4,Acan save babies across the world
OL,5,
OL,6,FHulme, from English Frankton, in north
OL,7,FShropshire, said she hoped that,
OL,8,Ffollowing her own experience, the trial
OL,9,Fwould lead to a widely available
OL,10,Fvaccine to help fight the bacteria in
OL,11,Fchildbirth.
